# Mirrors `.cache/.gitignore`: only results that cannot be reproduced are committed.
#
# Calculix and Code_Aster are conda-installable, so their results are re-measured on every
# machine that builds the report and committing them would freeze a number someone can just compute.
# Abaqus and Sestra cannot be run in CI, so when a licensed machine produces `nafems_*_aba_*` /
# `nafems_*_ses_*` snapshots, those DO get committed -- that is what puts their columns in the table.
*_ca_*
*_ccx_*
*.png
